      "statement": "Telemetry configuration: CELLD_OTEL_SINK selects the sink (default bucket), CELLD_OTEL_BUCKET can override the bucket (same endpoint and credentials), CELLD_OTEL_RETENTION defaults to 30d (none disables deletion), CELLD_OTEL_FLUSH_MS defaults to 300000 and CELLD_OTEL_FLUSH_BYTES to 5242880 (whichever limit is reached first flushes), and the standard OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER / OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT / OTEL_SERVICE_NAME variables apply for the otlp sink.",
